# Design evidence sets ARE tracked: the root .gitignore ignores *.png repo-wide (and *.PNG,
# which a case-insensitive checkout also matches against .png), so the before/after snapshot
# sets under docs/design/ are re-included here.
!docs/design/**/*.png
